omplete two T2-T3-T4 chows (giving Pure Double Chow for 1 point), maintain my Red Dragon pung (2 points), and the B7-B8-B9 chow. The pair would be B3. With 3 T4 tiles still unshown, this gives reasonable winning chances with at least 3+ points.\n\nAnswer: Play B2"}
